{"title": "Jasra", "pageid": 2071, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Placeholder\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Placeholder\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"300\">File:Placeholder</span></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p>Jasra is a powerful sorceress from the shadow Kashfa, lover to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Brand\" title=\"Brand\">Brand</a></b> and the mother of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Luke\" title=\"Luke\">Luke</a></b>. Jasra was the one time tutor to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Julia\" title=\"Julia\">Julia</a></b> and former handmaid to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Dara\" title=\"Dara\">Dara</a></b>. She has venomous lips and a thirst for power.\n</p><dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Jasra?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501222057\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 318/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.980      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    1.980      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2071-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260501222057 and revision id 4516. Rendering was triggered b